# Multiblock Tooltips
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.machine_type=Modular Pressure Tube Reactor (MPTR)
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc1=Multi-phase nuclear fission via thermal neutron chain reactions.
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc2=Neutrons scatter in top-layer 2D hatch grid with fuel, coolants, other devices.
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc3=Fuel decay emits fast neutrons; moderators turn them into thermal neutrons.
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc4=Absorbed neutron flux heats components, affecting fuel reactivity. Heat spreads.
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc5=Walls redistribute absorbed heat. Maintenance permits coolant heat transfer.
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc6=Item pipe casing tier progresses max hatch temperature | liquid fuel | coolant:
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc7= - Electrum: %s | thorium | IC2 coolant
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc8= - Platinum: %s | uranium | distilled water (breeds deuterium)
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc9= - Osmium: %s | plutonium | external coolant loops via high-pressure hatches
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc10= - Quantium: %s | excited uranium | heavy water (breeds tritium)
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc11= - Fluxed electrum: %s | excited thorium
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc12= - Black plutonium: %s | excited plutonium
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc13=Match high-pressure hatches in bottom control-rod layer to return coolant to loop.
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc14=Control rods absorb neutrons via redstone level; controller SCRAM overrides to 100%.
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc15=Outputs depleted fuels / byproducts to output buses/hatches.
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc16=Inserting coolant into dry hatches above boiling point causes hull damage!
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc17=Overheating hatches voids contents and adds hull damage; 100% causes meltdown!
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc18=Nuclear control hatches expose reactor state to redstone logic and OpenComputers.
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc19=Radiovoltaic cells convert neutron flux to EU (up to 2A each) in multiamp dynamos.
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.desc20=Hull damage repair requires maintenance with average temperature below 10% of max.
gt.multiblock.nuclearreactor.finisher=GregTech nuclear power

